ess-map-20260921/publications/haless-deep-research-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"bd18d6a8d8b3bf8007730b4c0ff0a69e5608ad29c64e49a2c0c82b57aa9dc93c","mapActorIds":["R62","R50","R67"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"ca09-text-hl26-cr-fourth-dhujat-war-1701","year":1701,"endYear":1712,"title":"1701—1712年：第四次Dhujat战争","description":"魔军趁Jadd内部争斗主动进攻Khiraspid、Keyattordha与Sempherong；1702围城受阻，Azkare与Lot Dekkhang介入。1706 Dragon被调离，1712战争以魔军失去一处重要堡垒和双方僵持告终。堡垒未给出足以采用的具体省级归属，故仅保留文字战争叙述。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:bwclose26-jadd-wiki-30147","manual:hl26-core-doc-27a045896ed2","manual:hl26-core-unified-haless-918310f82183"],"sourceUrl":"https://anbennar.fandom.com/wiki/The_Command?oldid=30147","sourceTitle":"The Command","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"status":"explicit-source-date","locator":"Command Rahen //w:p[55]; Unified body/p[655]","note":"year为来源标示的事件或区间起年；正文保留战争跨度。Google原件当前快照的修订与批准状态未确认。"},"dateStatus":"source-interval","geometryNote":"仅文本；地名与战争范围不等于EU4省级归属变化。","originRecordId":"manual:hl26-cr-fourth-dhujat-war-1701","originBatchId":"manual:hl26-integrated","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-publication.json","manifestSha256":"a0d897ad645ad22ee35e296ebf6c068dbbf46ebaa69e7fb79f843477341f98dd","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"26401307b8e180dfaee63ecab6a726c6fae7c258b3fc0a63669580de86364fb6","mapActorIds":["R62","R67","F51","Y86","Y58"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"ca09-text-hl26-cr-insubordination-1784","year":1784,"endYear":1808,"title":"1784—1808年：大叛乱（来源分期有冲突）","description":"专篇以1784 Dragon与Tiger起事、1786 Elephant分离叙述；中央承认放弃烟州以集中作战。Tiger首都1805、Elephant首都1806失守，军团被解散，专篇将主战终点设1808。Wiki另有1783开端及1786—1806分期；此条为有争议文献叙述，不裁定唯一日期。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:bwclose26-jadd-wiki-30147","manual:hl26-core-doc-b317c9d2d7d3","manual:hl26-core-unified-haless